{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19871","headline":"伤春 · 孟郊","name":"伤春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两河春草海水清，十年征战城郭腥。\n乱兵杀儿将女去，二月三月花冥冥。\n千里无人旋风起，莺啼燕语荒城里。\n春色不拣墓傍株，红颜皓色逐春去。\n春去春来那得知，今人看花古人墓，令人惆怅山头路。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}